WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.016
Cy, Panther, and Bobby stared at Jane.

2
00:00:04.017 --> 00:00:09.113
"Did you just wish for wings?" Cy asked in disbelief.

3
00:00:09.114 --> 00:00:12.903
Jane's eyes welled up with tears as she nodded.

4
00:00:12.904 --> 00:00:16.302
"I've always wanted to fly."

5
00:00:16.303 --> 00:00:20.884
Suddenly everyone started talking at once.

6
00:00:20.885 --> 00:00:24.861
"Ahem." Huey cleared his throat.

7
00:00:24.862 --> 00:00:29.434
When nobody paid attention to him, Huey clapped his hands loudly.

8
00:00:29.435 --> 00:00:35.700
"If I may interrupt," he said, "it is Jane's wish to fly.

9
00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:39.208
And it is too late to undo her wish!"

10
00:00:39.209 --> 00:00:44.178
Huey crossed his arms and leaned against his shell.

11
00:00:44.179 --> 00:00:47.390
"Oh, my back is itchy."

12
00:00:47.391 --> 00:00:51.071
Bobby tried to reach behind him to scratch his back.

13
00:00:51.072 --> 00:00:54.274
"Me too," Panther said.

14
00:00:54.275 --> 00:00:59.100
"What's going on?" Cy turned his head to look at his back.

15
00:00:59.101 --> 00:01:01.710
Two white bumps appeared.

16
00:01:01.711 --> 00:01:06.293
Then they started to grow and grow and grow.

17
00:01:06.294 --> 00:01:11.521
Soon the children looked as if they had a huge white bag on each shoulder.

18
00:01:11.522 --> 00:01:15.404
"Oh, my goodness," whispered Panther.

19
00:01:15.405 --> 00:01:17.642
"We have wings."

20
00:01:17.643 --> 00:01:20.606
She wiggled the white humps on her back.

21
00:01:20.607 --> 00:01:24.533
Feathers flew everywhere.

22
00:01:24.534 --> 00:01:28.535
"But how do we fly?" asked Bobby.

23
00:01:28.536 --> 00:01:30.755
Huey closed his eyes.

24
00:01:30.756 --> 00:01:33.935
"Don't look at me," he said.

25
00:01:33.936 --> 00:01:37.251
"My fins aren't for flying."

26
00:01:37.252 --> 00:01:41.133
With that, Huey disappeared back into his shell.

27
00:01:41.134 --> 00:01:43.951
Cy lowered the shell back into the well.

28
00:01:43.952 --> 00:01:47.490
Meanwhile, the others tried to use their wings.

29
00:01:47.491 --> 00:01:50.497
Bobby squeezed his eyes together.

30
00:01:50.498 --> 00:01:54.443
With his fists clenched, he made groaning noises.

31
00:01:54.444 --> 00:02:00.319
"You look like you have to use the restroom," giggled Jane.

32
00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:06.125
"Well, you try to do it then," Bobby said, his face turning red.

33
00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:10.411
Jane closed her eyes and calmly let out a long breath.

34
00:02:10.412 --> 00:02:15.900
Then, like umbrellas unfolding, the two humps on her back opened up.

35
00:02:15.901 --> 00:02:18.999
They turned into beautiful angel wings.

36
00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:22.349
The wings were about three meters across.

37
00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:26.636
"Wow!" the others shouted in amazement.

38
00:02:26.637 --> 00:02:30.084
Jane lifted her head and bent her knees.

39
00:02:30.085 --> 00:02:32.548
Then she pushed off with her feet.

40
00:02:32.549 --> 00:02:36.640
As she got higher, Jane's wings began to flap.

41
00:02:36.641 --> 00:02:41.775
"I'm flying! I'm flying!" she screamed excitedly.

42
00:02:41.776 --> 00:02:45.775
Her brothers and sister did exactly as Jane had done.

43
00:02:45.776 --> 00:02:51.833
One by one, their wings opened up and soon they joined their sister in the sky.

44
00:02:51.834 --> 00:02:54.809
"Jane!" shouted Panther.

45
00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:58.332
"This is the best wish we've made so far."

46
00:02:58.333 --> 00:03:04.928
Jane beamed at her sister as she flew up higher toward the sun.

47
00:03:04.929 --> 00:03:09.254
"Hey, look!" Bobby pointed down at the ground.

48
00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:11.703
Beneath them was their village.

49
00:03:11.704 --> 00:03:17.552
The children could see people walking up and down the streets.

50
00:03:17.553 --> 00:03:21.582
"They look like bugs," laughed Cy.

51
00:03:21.583 --> 00:03:25.850
"There's Aunt Martha's house!" Panther pointed ahead.

52
00:03:25.851 --> 00:03:30.874
Like a flock of birds, the children flew smoothly in that direction.

53
00:03:30.875 --> 00:03:33.290
"There's Aunt Martha."

54
00:03:33.291 --> 00:03:37.374
Cy held one hand over his eyes as he peered down.

55
00:03:37.375 --> 00:03:41.498
"She's planting some flowers," Panther added.

56
00:03:41.499 --> 00:03:46.586
"Oh, and there's our baby Lamb!" shouted Jane.

57
00:03:46.587 --> 00:03:51.610
Sure enough, Lamb was sitting on a blanket playing with his toys.

58
00:03:51.611 --> 00:03:54.263
"Aunt Martha! Lamb!"

59
00:03:54.264 --> 00:03:58.195
Bobby suddenly began to shout and wave his arms.

60
00:03:58.196 --> 00:04:02.862
"Bobby, stop it!" Cy grabbed Bobby's hand.

61
00:04:02.863 --> 00:04:07.462
Because the boys were arguing, they forgot to keep flapping their wings.

62
00:04:07.463 --> 00:04:14.392
"Whoa!" Cy and Bobby began falling.

63
00:04:14.393 --> 00:04:17.292
Lamb heard familiar voices.

64
00:04:17.293 --> 00:04:21.177
"Bobba! Cy!" he said.

65
00:04:21.178 --> 00:04:27.024
"Did you say your brothers' names?" Aunt Martha asked proudly.

66
00:04:27.025 --> 00:04:34.027
"Cy. Bobba." Lamb reached out his chubby arms to the sky.

67
00:04:34.028 --> 00:04:39.980
"Cy! Bobby!" shouted Panther and Jane.

68
00:04:39.981 --> 00:04:42.942
"Keep moving your wings!"

69
00:04:42.943 --> 00:04:48.319
But the boys kept falling and falling.

